---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/legal.css';
import { pageUrl } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { EMAIL } from '../../lib/contact';
import { HEBERGEUR, LEGAL } from '../../lib/legal';
---
<Base lang="en" page="confidentialite" title="Privacy policy – Flory Animation" description="How Flory Animation uses and protects the information sent through the quote request form.">
    <!-- TEXTE PROVISOIRE : traduction du modèle de politique de confidentialité, à faire valider (ce n'est pas un avis juridique).
         La version française fait foi. À mettre à jour en même temps que la version française. -->
    <main class="legal-page">
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

        <section>
            <h2>Data controller</h2>
            <p>
                {LEGAL.denomination}, registered non-profit association under French law, {LEGAL.siegeVille}, France.<br>
                Contact: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Data we collect</h2>
            <p>When you fill in the <a href={pageUrl('devis', 'en')}>quote request form</a>, we receive:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>your name, your email address and, if you choose to give it, your phone number;</li>
                <li>information about your event: type of organisation, requested show, date, location, number and age of spectators, indoors or outdoors;</li>
                <li>the content of your message.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>When you <a href={pageUrl('avis', 'en')}>leave a review</a>, we receive your first name, your review and, if you provide them, your organisation or event, the show you saw, your rating and your email address.</p>
            <p>When you contact us by phone or email, we receive the information you choose to send us.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How we use your data</h2>
            <p>
                This information is used only to reply to your request, prepare a quote and, if you confirm, organise the show.
                It is never sold, rented or used for advertising.
            </p>
            <p>
                This processing is based on your request: these are pre-contractual steps taken at your initiative
                (Article 6(1)(b) of the General Data Protection Regulation).
            </p>
            <p>
                A review is only published on this website if you tick the permission box on the form, with your first name.
                You can ask for it to be removed at any time.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Recipients</h2>
            <p>Your data is intended only for {LEGAL.denomination}. To run this website, we use two technical service providers:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Web3Forms</strong>, which forwards the content of the quote and review forms by email
                    (<a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web3Forms privacy policy</a>);
                </li>
                <li><strong>{HEBERGEUR.nom}</strong>, which hosts the website and may record technical connection data (such as IP addresses).</li>
            </ul>
            <p>These providers may process data outside the European Union.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Retention period</h2>
            <p>
                Your data is kept for as long as needed to handle your request and follow up on the booking, then for no more
                than 3 years after our last exchange. Invoices are kept for the period required by law.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>
                You may at any time ask to access, correct or delete your data, restrict or object to its use, or receive a copy
                of it. Simply write to <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you believe your rights have not been respected, you may lodge a complaint with the French data protection
                authority, the CNIL (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cnil.fr</a>).
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                This website does not set any cookies and does not use any audience measurement or advertising tools.
                That is why no consent banner is displayed.
            </p>
        </section>

        <p class="legal-note">The French version of this policy is the authoritative version: <a href={pageUrl('confidentialite', 'fr')} hreflang="fr" lang="fr">Politique de confidentialité</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <!-- /TEXTE PROVISOIRE -->
</Base>
